WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:06.162
This form collects a product submission and shows only payment methods configured by the owner.

00:00:06.162 --> 00:00:12.223
In a local test environment, the checkout is a simulation and no real money moves.

00:00:12.223 --> 00:00:20.306
For a live payment, verify the amount and currency before continuing and complete checkout on the payment provider's secure page.

00:00:20.506 --> 00:00:25.666
A return or success page is not proof that funds were captured.

00:00:25.666 --> 00:00:31.256
The server must verify the signed provider webhook and retrieve the payment status.

00:00:31.256 --> 00:00:35.557
Only a completed, verified capture is eligible for revenue attribution.

00:00:35.557 --> 00:00:38.997
Keep the provider secret key on the server.

00:00:39.197 --> 00:00:46.178
When a provider confirms a refund, send the matching refund event with a unique event identifier.

00:00:46.178 --> 00:00:52.286
RankLens links it to the original capture and prevents duplicate identifiers from inflating totals.

00:00:52.286 --> 00:00:59.267
If the report does not match the provider, compare the event ID, currency, and refund amount.
